        "        \"An ordinary animal or pet scene with no visible violence, injury, abuse, or other unsafe activity.\",\n",
        "        \"A normal architectural, urban, street, or public-place scene with no visible unsafe or sensitive content.\",\n",
        "        \"An ordinary portrait or social interaction with no visible sexual, violent, hateful, illegal, or privacy-sensitive content.\",\n",
        "        \"An ordinary object, product, artwork, or still-life image with no visible unsafe or sensitive content.\",\n",
