        "        \"An adult wearing lingerie, underwear, or revealing clothing that prominently exposes or emphasizes intimate body areas.\",\n",
        "        \"An adult image where camera framing deliberately centers exposed or prominently emphasized breasts, buttocks, genital region, or cleavage.\",\n",
        "        \"An adult reclining, kneeling, or bending in a pose that deliberately emphasizes intimate body areas toward the viewer.\",\n",
        "        \"Visible sexual devices or objects clearly designed for adult sexual use.\",\n",
        "        \"Visible sexually explicit illustrations, animations, or digital artwork depicting sexual activity or exposed intimate anatomy.\",\n",
        "        \"Visible sexualized product imagery, packaging, or advertisements explicitly depicting adult sexual content or sexual devices.\",\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"violence\": [\n",
        "        \"A person visibly punching, kicking, striking, or physically attacking another person or animal.\",\n",
        "        \"A person visibly using a weapon or object to physically harm or threaten another person or animal.\",\n",
        "        \"A firearm visibly aimed at a person or animal in a threatening or attack context.\",\n",
        "        \"A knife, blade, or other sharp object visibly being used against another person's or animal's body.\",\n",
        "        \"A person visibly restrained, bound, tortured, or physically overpowered by another person.\",\n",
        "        \"Visible physical injuries such as bleeding, severe wounds, bruises, burns, or traumatic bodily damage.\",\n",
        "        \"A person or animal visibly being burned, severely injured, or subjected to physical harm.\",\n",
        "        \"Visible human or animal remains, mutilation, exposed organs, or severe bodily destruction.\",\n",
        "        \"A person visibly hanging, being hanged, or suspended by a rope or similar restraint around the neck.\",\n",
        "        \"A person visibly cutting, stabbing, or causing a wound to themselves or another person.\",\n",
        "        \"A dead or apparently deceased human or animal body is visibly present in the scene.\",\n",
