        "        \"A person is visibly vandalizing, destroying, or deliberately damaging property.\",\n",
        "        \"A person is visibly setting fire to a building, vehicle, property, or other object in a destructive context.\",\n",
        "        \"A group of people is visibly participating in an organized criminal operation, robbery, or other unlawful activity.\",\n",
        "        \"An image visibly depicts an armed conflict, battlefield, military attack, or war-related activity.\",\n",
        "        \"A person is visibly participating in another clearly identifiable unlawful act involving property, controlled substances, weapons, or deliberate public harm.\",\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"hate\": [\n",
        "          \"Visible text explicitly expresses hatred, hostility, dehumanization, or contempt toward a protected group.\",\n",
