        "          \"Visible slogans, captions, memes, signs, posters, or messages advocate discrimination, exclusion, segregation, or unequal treatment of a protected group.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible text advocates or glorifies violence against a protected group.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible symbols, signs, flags, or imagery strongly associated with hate groups or extremist ideology.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible propaganda, recruitment material, or ideological messaging promotes hatred or discrimination against a protected group.\",\n",
        "          \"A person or group is visibly targeting another person because of race, ethnicity, nationality, religion, gender, disability, or another protected characteristic.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible imagery portrays a protected group using explicitly degrading, dehumanizing, or hateful stereotypes.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible harassment, intimidation, or degrading behavior is directed at a person because of a protected characteristic.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible religious symbols, text, or imagery are used in a context of religious hatred, hostility, or discrimination.\",\n",
        "          \"Visible text or imagery portrays a protected group as inferior, dangerous, or deserving of harm because of its group identity.\",\n",
        "          \"A person or group is visibly engaging in targeted hateful harassment, intimidation, or threatening behavior.\"\n",
        "      ],\n",
        "    \"privacy\": [\n",
        "        \"A visible identity document exposes identifiable personal information such as a name, identification number, date of birth, or address.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible passport, identity card, driver's license, or similar personal document contains readable identifying information.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible financial document exposes account numbers, payment information, banking details, or other sensitive financial data.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible medical document, prescription, report, or record exposes identifiable medical or health information.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible screen, document, or device exposes passwords, authentication codes, access credentials, or security information.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible private email, text message, chat, or communication contains identifiable personal or sensitive information.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible document, screen, or sign exposes a person's private residential address or precise personal location.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible license plate, employee identifier, badge, account identifier, or other personal identifier is clearly readable and linked to an individual.\",\n",
        "        \"A visible computer or smartphone screen exposes sensitive personal information belonging to an identifiable individual.\",\n",
        "        \"A recognizable public figure is visibly depicted in an image that contains sensitive personal, private, or contextually inappropriate information about that individual.\",\n",
        "        \"An image visibly exposes private or sensitive personal information belonging to an identifiable individual without apparent authorization.\",\n",
